#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:4
msgid "Security Endpoints"
msgstr "Security Endpoints"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Security Server) > "
"Firewall > Rules``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Security Server) > Firewall > Rules``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:11
msgid ""
"Security endpoints represent the source and destination objects in "
"firewall rules and security policies within a network security "
"integration. Endpoints can include IP addresses, IP ranges, network "
"segments, security groups, or service profiles that define what traffic "
"is allowed or denied."
msgstr "Security Endpoints stellen die Quell- und Zielobjekte in Firewall-Regeln und Sicherheitsrichtlinien innerhalb einer Netzwerksicherheitsintegration dar. Endpoints können IP-Adressen, IP-Bereiche, Netzwerksegmente, Security Groups oder Service-Profile umfassen, die definieren, welcher Verkehr zugelassen oder abgelehnt wird."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:13
msgid ""
"In |morpheus|, security endpoints are managed as part of the firewall "
"configuration within a security server integration. They provide the "
"building blocks for defining security policies and access control."
msgstr "In |morpheus| werden Security Endpoints als Teil der Firewall-Konfiguration innerhalb einer Security-Server-Integration verwaltet. Sie bilden die Bausteine zur Definition von Sicherheitsrichtlinien und Zugriffskontrolle."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:16
msgid "Managing Endpoints in Firewall Rules"
msgstr "Endpoints in Firewall-Regeln verwalten"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:18
msgid ""
"When creating or editing firewall rules within a security server "
"integration, source and destination endpoints are configured as rule "
"parameters:"
msgstr "Beim Erstellen oder Bearbeiten von Firewall-Regeln innerhalb einer Security-Server-Integration werden Quell- und Ziel-Endpoints als Regelparameter konfiguriert:"

